# Vulnerability in transformers for arbitrary code execution:
#   https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-29pf-2h5f-8g72
#   https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-fgcw-684q-jj6r
# Both vulnerabilities require to craft a malicious model and load it with transformers. We do not load any untrusted models in this project.
